{"id":"annexe-12-tonalites","numero":24,"titre":"Annexe : les 12 tonalités","partie":4,"niveau":null,"statut":"validée","sousParties":["24.1 Accords diatoniques et emprunts courants","24.2 Dominantes secondaires","24.3 Diminués de passage montants"],"exercices":0,"intro":[{"t":"paragraphe","texte":"Ces tableaux donnent les accords de chaque tonalité majeure, pour transposer une grille Nashville ou vérifier une transposition à vue."}],"contenu":[{"titre":"24.1 Accords diatoniques et emprunts courants","blocs":[{"t":"paragraphe","texte":"Les trois dernières colonnes sont les emprunts les plus utilisés en louange (chapitre 12)."},{"t":"tableau","entetes":["Tonalité","1","2m","3m","4","5","6m","7ø","b6","b7","4m"],"lignes":[["Do (C)","C","Dm","Em","F","G","Am","Bø","Ab","Bb","Fm"],["Réb (Db)","Db","Ebm","Fm","Gb","Ab","Bbm","Cø","A","B","Gbm"],["Ré (D)","D","Em","F#m","G","A","Bm","C#ø","Bb","C","Gm"],["Mib (Eb)","Eb","Fm","Gm","Ab","Bb","Cm","Dø","B","Db","Abm"],["Mi (E)","E","F#m","G#m","A","B","C#m","D#ø","C","D","Am"],["Fa (F)","F","Gm","Am","Bb","C","Dm","Eø","Db","Eb","Bbm"],["Fa# (F#)","F#","G#m","A#m","B","C#","D#m","E#ø","D","E","Bm"],["Sol (G)","G","Am","Bm","C","D","Em","F#ø","Eb","F","Cm"],["Lab (Ab)","Ab","Bbm","Cm","Db","Eb","Fm","Gø","E","Gb","Dbm"],["La (A)","A","Bm","C#m","D","E","F#m","G#ø","F","G","Dm"],["Sib (Bb)","Bb","Cm","Dm","Eb","F","Gm","Aø","Gb","Ab","Ebm"],["Si (B)","B","C#m","D#m","E","F#","G#m","A#ø","G","A","Em"]]},{"t":"paragraphe","texte":"En Réb, Mib et Lab, certains emprunts s'écrivent en théorie avec un double bémol ou un bémol sur une note naturelle (Bbb, Cb, Fb). Le tableau donne le nom le plus lisible : A, B, E."},{"t":"paragraphe","texte":"**Pour un chant en mineur :** lis la ligne du relatif majeur en partant du 6m. La mineur utilise la ligne de Do : Am, Bø, C, Dm, Em, F, G."}]},{"titre":"24.2 Dominantes secondaires","blocs":[{"t":"tableau","entetes":["Tonalité","V7 (vers 1)","V7/2","V7/3","V7/4","V7/5","V7/6"],"lignes":[["Do (C)